2026-01-01 open Assets:A
2026-01-01 open Assets:B

2026-01-02 * "good: before"
  Assets:A  1 EUR
  Assets:B  -1 EUR

2026-01-03 * "bad: a division by zero is the left operand of another operation"
  Assets:A  (1 / 0) + 1 EUR
  Assets:B  -1 EUR

2026-01-04 * "good: after"
  Assets:A  2 EUR
  Assets:B  -2 EUR
